abstract: >-
  AI Stats is a sourced browser workbench for comparing AI model pricing,
  provider routes, context limits, latency, speed, benchmark coverage, and
  public catalog metadata from Artificial Analysis, Epoch AI, OpenRouter,
  Hugging Face Hub, and LiteLLM.
keywords:
  - AI model comparison
  - LLM pricing
  - AI benchmarks
  - model selection
  - provider routing
